[00:00.00] 作词 : Andy Hurley/Joe Trohman/Patrick Stump/Pete Wentz
[00:00.00][by:希望孙婉永远开心]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Andy Hurley/Joe Trohman/Patrick Stump/Pete Wentz
[00:06.82]You're Crashing, But You're No Wave
[00:06.82]士可杀，不可辱
[00:12.02]The D.A. is dressed to the nines
[00:12.02]地方检察官正襟危坐
[00:15.88]In the mirror he practices all his lines
[00:15.88]对着镜子练习着他所有的辩词
[00:20.92]To his closing argument twelve hearts beat in favor
[00:20.92]他最后的辩词令十二个陪审团点头称是
[00:25.94]I'm guessing that he read the morning paper
[00:25.94]我猜他已经读了早报
[00:30.36]The headline reads "the man hangs", but the jury doesn't
[00:30.36]头版头条便是“此人将处以绞刑，而陪审团不以为然。”
[00:39.37]And everyone's looking for relief
[00:39.37]每个人都在争取减刑
[00:41.61]United States versus disbelief
[00:41.61]全国上下难以置信
[00:43.98]Mothers cast tears on both sides of the aisle
[00:43.98]祖国母亲为法庭上的正反两方悲不自胜
[00:48.32]Clear your throat and face the world
[00:48.32]义无反顾，一往无前
[00:50.48]The verdict falls like bachelors for bad luck girls
[00:50.48]判决已下，白纸黑字，生死成章
[00:52.69]Only breathing with the aid of denial.
[00:52.69]除了以暴制恶外无能为力
[00:56.87]Case open, case shut,
[00:56.87]能否公开案件审理
[01:00.89]But you could pay to close it like a casket
[01:00.89]而你可以用钱解决一切
[01:05.47]Baby boy can't lift his headache head
[01:05.47]大局已定，蚍蜉难撼树
[01:10.50]Isn't it tragic? (Whoaaa-ooo)
[01:10.50]难道不是一场悲剧？
[01:23.37]He glances at his peers sitting seven to twelve stacked
[01:23.37]他张望法庭四下，皆是他的同僚
[01:27.93]On one to six the gallery is hushed
[01:27.93]旁听席鸦雀无声，一片死寂
[01:31.84]Boys in three pieces dream of grandstanding and bravado
[01:31.84]被告的少年想要突破桎梏，冲出重围，然后发现这只不过一场太真实的梦
[01:36.85]The city sleeps in a cell notwithstanding what we all know
[01:36.85]这座城市本身又是一个无处可逃的镀金牢笼
[01:41.51]Hang on a rope or bated breath
[01:41.51]左右为难，身陷囹圄
[01:46.18]Whichever you prefer
[01:46.18]束手无策，如何是好
[01:50.30]And everyone's looking for relief
[01:50.30]每个人都在争取减刑
[01:52.76]A bidding war for an old flame's grief
[01:52.76]这是一场非宫廷政变
[01:54.98]The cause, the kid, the course, the charm, and the curse
[01:54.98]无言以表众人心
[01:59.42]Not a word that could make you comprehend
[01:59.42]千语难解万生情
[02:01.44]Too well dressed for the witness stand
[02:01.44]证人衣装得体，信心满满站在一旁
[02:03.86]The press prays for whichever headline's worse
[02:03.86]新闻媒体只在乎标题是否猎奇
[02:07.93]Case open, case shut,
[02:07.93]能否公开案件审理
[02:12.00]But you could pay to close it like a casket
[02:12.00]而你可以用钱解决一切
[02:16.47]Baby boy can't lift his headache head
[02:16.47]大局已定，蚍蜉难撼树
[02:21.60]Isn't it tragic? (Whoaaa-ooo)
[02:21.60]难道不是一场悲剧？
[02:26.20]Fresh pressed suit and tie
[02:26.20]用完最后的晚餐
[02:28.41]Unimpressed birds sing and die
[02:28.41]已是万念俱灰，纵情歌唱，静候死亡
[02:30.62]Can talk my way out of anything
[02:30.62]任何巧舌如簧的辩词都无法洗脱我的罪名
[02:34.90]The foreman reads the verdict
[02:34.90]法官宣告了审判结果：
[02:37.11]"In the above entitled actions we find the defendant..."
[02:37.11]“根据上述陈议，我们以法律的名义宣布被告..”
[02:42.13]Guilty...Guilty...Guilty...Guilty...
[02:42.13]罪名成立
